{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Blur Background – Studio Blur》是一款專為創作者而設的影片錄製工具，讓你在按下錄影前，毋須整理房間也能獲得乾淨畫面。它適合創作者、賣家、教練與創業者使用，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>模糊背景錄製影片</h2>\n<p>提供即時背景模糊，具備 Cinema、Strong 與 Extreme 三種效果；亦可改用相片、影片或純色背景，或切換至 23 款動態工作室背景。支援前後鏡頭、9:16、1:1、16:9 錄影，可選擇直向或橫向構圖，並可平滑肌膚；完成後自動儲存至相簿，全程在裝置上處理，毋須帳戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-483-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-484-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-485-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-486-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-487-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Blur Background – Studio Blur</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T22:59:32.826033+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":326,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}